From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:41:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2582/3799] soh: rename func_80ACA690 ->
 EnOwl_WaitForHeadReturn

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: holds until the head-turn counter returns to zero before unfolding; the counter's exact meaning beyond driving the head is not established
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
index 744490e3a..3261932b6 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
@@ -319,7 +319,8 @@ void EnOwl_SetSwitchAndUnfold(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnOwl_SetupUnfoldWings(this);  // was func_80ACA5C8 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
-void func_80ACA690(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was func_80ACA690: holds until the head-turn counter returns to zero before unfolding; the counter's exact meaning beyond driving the head is not established
+void EnOwl_WaitForHeadReturn(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
     if ((this->unk_3EE & 0x3F) == 0) {
         EnOwl_SetSwitchAndUnfold(this, play);  // was func_80ACA62C [LLM:HIGH]
     }
@@ -364,7 +365,7 @@ void func_80ACA7E0(EnOwl* this, PlayState* play) {
         } else {
             this->actionFlags &= ~2;
             func_80ACA71C(this);
-            this->actionFunc = func_80ACA690;
+            this->actionFunc = EnOwl_WaitForHeadReturn;  // was func_80ACA690 [LLM:GUESS]
         }
         this->actor.flags &= ~ACTOR_FLAG_TALK_OFFER_AUTO_ACCEPTED;
     }
